# ---- hand-cue videos ----------------------------------------------
# Everything under cues/ is excluded by default, then re-admitted per
# system. A system whose rights belong to someone else stays out of the
# public repo no matter what lands in the folder; scripts/check_cues.py
# is the backstop if one is force-added.
cues/*
!cues/README.md
!cues/own/
!cues/none/
